        "date_thought_1": "Jan 16, 2026",
        "thought_1": "Today, the weight of finals and endless tasks has finally lifted.\n\nMy sleep has been a chaotic blur lately—restless and sparse.\n\nAround 9 PM, a wave of malaise drove me to bed, where I lingered in that hollow space between wakefulness and dreams. By 11:56 PM, I found myself fully awake, yet deeply fatigued.\n\nI began listening to 'The Shorekeeper’s Theme.' It is remarkably soothing, yet it carries a defiant, positive undertone: I want to play the piano, I want to train, I want to live—truly live—for myself. I crave a life of warmth and intensity; I refuse to be just another exam robot.\n\nWe are meant to live lives of abundance; even when the world bears down on us, we must not allow our spirits to wither.\n\nIn the embrace of the piano, my mind finally exhales. My soul drifts back to a carefree past, where beautiful moments flicker like scenes from a vintage film.\n\nI am profoundly moved.",
